        "widgets": [
          {
            "definition": {
              "background_color": "yellow",
              "content": "**A different data source from the deploy tiles above.** These read DORA deployment events, pushed from each `Fly Deploy` workflow *after* the boot-health gate passes (RC1-336) — a deployment here means the app actually booted. Sources today: the three Fly apps. **www.hihelloreid.com joins via RC1-354** (Heroku → DORA API).\n\n**Change lead time** (seconds; p25/p50/p75, weekly rollups) computes from the git range between consecutive deployment SHAs — verified live 2026-09-01. Percentiles are honest but thin until deploy volume grows.\n\n**Change failure rate and time to restore are deliberately absent** — no failure/incident source is wired yet; a CFR tile would read 0% and lie (RC1-336 descope).\n\nCount widgets pinned to **Past 1 Week**; frequency panel shows weekly rollups over a month.",
